 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Lauren, a Missouri resident, qualifies for a REPAYE payment plan. Her gross income is $39,200. She has one child, so there are two people in her household. The federal poverty guideline for Lauren is $18,310.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 519166,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What is Lauren’s discretionary income?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>REPAYE plans have payment amounts that are 10% of discretionary income.</p>\n<p>Discretionary income is the excess of 150% of the poverty guideline.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Find 150 percent of $18,310:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{1}}{\\text{.5(18,310)  =  \\$27,465}}\"></span>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Discretionary income is the excess over $27,465:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"39,200{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}27,465{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}\\$11,735\"></span>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Lauren’s discretionary income is $11,735.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$11,735"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 519167,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Under the REPAYE plan, she pays 10% of her discretionary income, but monthly. How much are Lauren’s REPAYE payments?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ten percent of her discretionary income of $11,735 is:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{0}}{\\text{.10(11,735)  =  \\$1,173}}{\\text{.50}}\"></span>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divide by 12 to find the monthly payment:</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"{\\text{1,173}}{\\text{.50 / 12  =  \\$97}}{\\text{.80}}\"></span>.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Lauren’s monthly payment is $97.80.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$97.80"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
